{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近髪の毛が\nとても染めやすくなったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆にすぐ抜けるようになり\n明るくなっちゃってます( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/16/5283911/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/16/5283911/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー何人にも、\n前より茶色くした(｡･o･｡)ﾉ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われるほどに...！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真だと余計に茶色すぎるなあ( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒髪ぱっつん時代！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/16/5283911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒髪も捨てがたいんですが、\n私、顔が濃いので髪も黒いと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしても濃く、より濃くなる\n気がしちゃうの(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、今ほどとは言わないけど\n茶髪の方が、顔にしっくりくる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と私は思ってる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと髪の毛も軽く見えるから\n巻き髪もふわっと、\n空気が入ったような感じになる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは黒髪と少し茶髪\nどっちが好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会社に届いていた、\n皆さんからの手紙とプレゼントを\n最近頂いてきました(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん有難うございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手紙とかってちゃんと届いてるの？\nって不安になりますよね(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"検閲もあって多少時間は\nかかるかもしれないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと私たちの手元に\n届いてます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じっくり読ませていただいてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざ手紙に書いて\n私に届けたい！と思ってくださった気持ち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"便箋や封筒、レイアウトなど\n沢山考えて選んで送ってくださった気持ち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手書きで時間をかけて\n内容を考えて書いてくださった気持ち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"励みになってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"力になってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん良かったら\n是非送ってください(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":